{"articleNo":"2300","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2300&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009년도 후기 대학원 휴·복학 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.08.07","hit":"15608","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>◀ 2009년도 후기 대학원 휴-복학 안내 ▶</span></p>\n<span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n</span>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">1. 휴&nbsp; 학</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;가. 신청기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2009. 8. 18(화) 10시~ 8.21(금) 24시 [4일간]<br><br><font color=\"#0000ff\">※ 기간 외 신청자 : 대학원지원팀(글로벌관412호)로 방문하여 신청 바람.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;나. 접수절차(우리대학 홈페이지 원스톱서비스에서 신청)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;→로그인→학적→휴학신청접수→군입대 및 질병휴학자 관련서류제출(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: -2.8pt\">24시간이내)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: -2.8pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;다. 휴학 확정여부 확인 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">접수 및 구비서류 제출 후 다음날 오후 1시이후<br><br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (휴일제외)<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp; →로그인→학적→학적 및 각종자료조회→학적변동 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">※일반휴학은 수업일수 1/4선(2009. 9.25)까지만 가능함.<br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\" size=\"3\">라. 인터넷으로 휴학 신청시 제출서류</font>\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"83\" bgcolor=\"#ffff00\" height=\"17\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">구분</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"64\" bgcolor=\"#ffff00\" height=\"17\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">일반휴학</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"294\" bgcolor=\"#ffff00\" height=\"17\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">군입대휴학</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"151\" bgcolor=\"#ffff00\" height=\"17\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">질병휴학</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"83\" height=\"60\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">제출해야</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">할 구비서류</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"64\" bgcolor=\"#ffff00\" height=\"60\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">제출서류 &nbsp;없음</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"294\" height=\"60\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;입영통지서 또는 군복무확인서 사본 1부</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">* 증빙서 하단에 학번 및 연락처 반드시 기재</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"151\" height=\"60\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;4주이상 진단서 1부</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 14.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -14.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">* </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: -1.5pt\">증빙서하단에학번 및 연락처 반드시 기재</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"83\" height=\"38\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">제출기일 및 장소</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"64\" bgcolor=\"#ffff00\" height=\"38\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">제출서류 &nbsp;없음</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"446\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"38\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;휴학신청 후 24시간 이내 제출해야 됨</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;대학원지원팀(글로벌관 412호)</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"83\" height=\"102\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">유의사항</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"64\" bgcolor=\"#ffff00\" height=\"102\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"446\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"102\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">* </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">구비서류 미제출자는 3일 후 휴학신청이 자동 취소됩니다.</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">* 구비서류 팩스발송자는 도착여부 확인 하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;FAX.(054)478-7020&nbsp; //&nbsp; TEL.(054)478-7015</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 12.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -12.6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">* 군입대 휴학 후 귀향조치 또는 입영거부 학생은 즉시 대학원지원팀에 신고하여야 합니다.</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"></span><p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">2. 복&nbsp; 학</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;가. 신청기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2009. 8. 18(화) ~ 8. 21(금) [4일간]</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 복학신청은 등록금 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">완납 후</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"> 다음날 오후 1시부터 신청 가능함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 등록금을 납부하고 휴학한 학생은 인터넷으로 복학신청이 가능함<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">군제대복학예정자의 전역일자가 1/4선(2009.9.26)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">이후일 경우<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;대학원지원팀로 문의 바람.<br><strong><u><font color=\"#0000ff\">※ 기간 외 신청자 : 대학원지원팀(글로벌관412호)로 방문하여 신청 바람.</font></u></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 35.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -35.1pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">&nbsp;나. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">접수절차(우리대학 홈페이지 원스톱서비스에서 신청<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">→ 로그인→학적→복학신청접수(특히, 예비군대상자는 정확한 개인정보입력바람) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 35.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -35.1pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 복학 확정여부 확인 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">접수 및 구비서류 제출 후 다음날 오후 1시 이후</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">(휴일제외)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;→로그인→학적→학적 및 각종자료조회→학적변동</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">※ 복학허가는 수업일수 1/4선(2009. 9.26)까지만 가능함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff00ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">단 등록기간(09. 8. 18~8. 21)내에 등록금 납부한 학생만 해당됨.<br><br><font color=\"#ff0000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;#</font>&nbsp; <font color=\"#ff0000\">8.21(금)등록금 납부자- 대학원지원팀(글로벌관412호) 방문하여 신청바람.</font></span></p>\n<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’한컴바탕’\">\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"center\"><br><strong><font size=\"4\">2009. 8<br>금오공과대학교 대학원장</font></strong></p>\n</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
